            "review_text": "Denis V\nBien Hoa, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nworth going as a group\nMar 2019 • Friends\nLofty, spacious, noisy, action packed,with prompt service - all good even before you get to the food. Very safe parking and a place easy to find. It could do with a 'sprucing up' or even remove the junk would help but it is Viet Nam so food tops all other considerations\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 3, 2019",
