            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Kaiserin",
            "review_text": "brendanstetson\nBirmingham, United Kingdom9 contributions\n0\nVery good Vietnamese seafood restaurant\nJan 2018 • Couples\nSurely the best restaurant in the city, but do not expect a luxury atmosphere !! It's a big restaurant, like a factory, huge, with very large tables and groups of Vietnamese customers who are celebrating something loudly. He has ponds at the entrance to choose your fresh fish. We ate very well (raw fish, raw shrimp, sardines in salad, frogs with curry sauce); All the sauces were amazingly tasty. Efficient staff but difficulties in speaking English. In addition, it is not expensive. A favorite !\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 26, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
